g. providing inclusive education for children with special needs; and
h. taking preventive measures in order to prevent violations of children's rights.
(2) The responsibility of the Regional Government in the effort of special protection for children as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be implemented by regional apparatus that carries out authority affairs in the social sector.
